# Read by the test stage alone, since dev copies nothing in. The .env files and
# Compose overrides hold this checkout's settings, not the tree's. Every
# top-level dot path is left out, so a per-user one such as .claude stays out
# without being named, and the project's own are let back in by name.
**/.git
/.*
/docker-compose.*.yml
/tmp/

!/.dockerignore
!/.dockerrepo
!/.env.example
!/.github
!/.gitignore
!/.gitmodules
